  <outcomeDeclaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" baseType="float"><defaultValue><value>0</value></defaultValue></outcomeDeclaration>

  <itemBody><p>A visual sequencing item asks the student to order field-study workflow regions.</p><extendedTextInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE"><prompt>Select the workflow regions in the order a field team should complete them: plan the sampling route, collect data, analyze the results, then write the recommendation report.<div><p>Source options:</p><ul><li>Plan sampling route</li><li>Collect water data</li><li>Report recommendations</li><li>Analyze results</li></ul></div><object data="hotspot-flow-unlabeled.svg" type="image/svg+xml" width="480" height="300"></object></prompt></extendedTextInteraction></itemBody>

</assessmentItem>",
}
`;

