  <itemBody><p>A garden-data item asks the student to match observations with reasonable interpretations.</p><extendedTextInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE"><prompt>Match each observation from a community garden study with the most reasonable interpretation.<div><p>Source options:</p><ul><li>Mulched beds stayed moist two days longer after watering.</li><li>Uncovered beds had more weeds by the third week.</li><li>Beds near the fence received less afternoon sun.</li><li>The garden sign was repainted on Saturday.</li><li>Mulch helped reduce water loss from the soil.</li><li>Bare soil may need more frequent weeding.</li><li>Light exposure was not identical across all beds.</li><li>This maintenance detail does not explain plant growth.</li></ul></div></prompt></extendedTextInteraction></itemBody>

