  <responseDeclaration identifier="RESPONSE_DECLARATION" cardinality="single" baseType="string"><correctResponse><value>reduced lunchroom waste</value></correctResponse></responseDeclaration>
  <responseDeclaration identifier="RESPONSE_OUTCOME" cardinality="single" baseType="string"><correctResponse><value>drop in bags collected after lunch</value></correctResponse></responseDeclaration>
  <outcomeDeclaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" baseType="float"><defaultValue><value>0</value></defaultValue></outcomeDeclaration>

  <itemBody><p>Read the sentence from a school-news article and choose the words that make the account accurate.</p><p>After a three-week pilot, the cafeteria team reported that the reusable tray program <textEntryInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE_DECLARATION"></textEntryInteraction> <span>Source options: reduced lunchroom waste; increased disposable packaging; left trash levels unchanged; stopped food donations</span>, and the strongest evidence was the <textEntryInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE_OUTCOME"></textEntryInteraction> <span>Source options: number of students who bought lunch; drop in bags collected after lunch; color of the new trays; menu posted on Monday</span>.</p></itemBody>
  <responseProcessing>
  <responseCondition>
    <responseIf>
      <match>
        <variable identifier="RESPONSE_DECLARATION"/>
        <correct identifier="RESPONSE_DECLARATION"/>
      </match>
      <setOutcomeValue identifier="SCORE">
        <sum>
          <variable identifier="SCORE"/>
          <baseValue baseType="float">1</baseValue>
        </sum>
      </setOutcomeValue>
    </responseIf>
  </responseCondition>
  <responseCondition>
    <responseIf>
      <match>
        <variable identifier="RESPONSE_OUTCOME"/>
        <correct identifier="RESPONSE_OUTCOME"/>
      </match>
      <setOutcomeValue identifier="SCORE">
        <sum>
          <variable identifier="SCORE"/>
          <baseValue baseType="float">1</baseValue>
        </sum>
      </setOutcomeValue>
    </responseIf>
  </responseCondition>
</responseProcessing>
</assessmentItem>",
}
`;

